        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(In the darkness, amid dim lamps, Maragatham sits reading a book in the middle of a somewhat brighter circle of light. Kalingan, staggering drunk, comes up behind her and covers her eyes... Startled, she knocks his hands away and rises.)"
