      "translation": {
        "english_text": "If he cared about age, would Manmathan shoot his arrow?... Is age a barrier to love? We should both break that barrier and throw it away! What use is it when little boys fall in love these days?.. None at all. People like us are great geniuses!.. men of the old days... our love is something special!.. (He comes close and touches her.)",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
