      "translation": {
        "english_text": "A flower shouldn’t be crushed just to smell it!... I’m a man with that kind of plan... A time will come!.. Then you’ll come and fall at my feet, begging for alms of love!... I won’t come the way everyone does..",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The ending of the verified Tamil source line is syntactically irregular (`எல்லோரும் வார் மாதிரி வரமாட்டே..`). The English renders the apparent sense conservatively without changing the Tamil authority."
